tmek ve sabr-ü tahaammül ile zahmetler çekib nefislerini it'ab eylemek hususunda müsabaka yaptılar.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"121\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 120.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 31.6 39.7 39.7 55.6 66.0 72.7 72.7 81.7 81.7 89.3 96.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"31.6 55.6 81.7 96.0 104.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onlar ki iyva eylediler- Resulüllâhı ve muhacirini kendi hanelerinden ve yerlerindne me'vâlar, meskenler tahsıs ederek iskân ettiler, yerleştirdiler<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"84\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 84.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 23.2 31.4 31.4 39.0 53.2 60.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 53.2 60.0 68.2\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve nusrat ettiler -onlarla beraber olub düş- manlarına karşı her vechile yardım ettiler, ensar oldular<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"79\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 78.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 33.0 33.0 39.7 39.7 39.7 47.3 47.3 55.6 55.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 62.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> işte bunlar- bu muhacirîn ve ensar<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"158\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 158.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 51.0 61.6 69.8 69.8 76.6 76.6 83.3 83.3 83.3 91.6 91.6 100.6 100.6 108.0 123.8 123.8 132.8 132.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.0 51.0 141.8\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ancak bunlardır ki hakkâ mü'minlerdir. -Bunlardır ki iymanlarını sûrenin başında da beyan olunduğu üzere iyfayı muktezasiyle tahkık etmiş hakıkate erdirmişlerdir<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"190\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 190.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 32.2 32.2 39.7 60.0 60.0 72.0 72.0 80.2 80.2 88.4 105.7 105.7 112.4 120.0 120.0 126.7 126.7 133.4 149.2 149.2 158.2 158.2 166.4\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.7 88.4 112.4 133.4 166.4 174.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bunlar içindir ki misalsiz bir mağfiret ve kerim bir rızk vardır.- Bir rızk ki ne mes'uliyyeti var, ne minneti. Fakat bu « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"186\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 186.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 3.0 9.7 9.7 16.6 37.6 48.0 56.3 56.3 63.0 63.0 69.7 69.7 69.7 78.0 78.0 87.0 87.0 94.6 110.3 110.3 119.3 119.3 137.3 153.7 153.7 160.6 160.6 160.6 168.0 168.0 176.3 176.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 37.6 137.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » kasrını mutlak ve bu gün mevcud olanlara münhasır bir kasrı hakıkî zannetmemelidir. Bu kasır, hicret farz iken dârı harbden hicret etmiyenlere nazaran izafîdir. Çünkü 75.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"184\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 183.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 32.3 39.0 48.0 48.0 58.4 58.4 74.3 81.0 89.3 89.3 96.0 102.7 102.7 118.4 129.0 135.7 135.7 144.7 144.7 152.3 159.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"32.3 96.0 118.4 144.7 159.0 167.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ba'demâ ya'ni sizin hicretinizden sonra <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"91\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 91.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 31.6 31.6 39.0 51.0 57.7 66.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 57.7 66.7 75.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> iyman edib muhaceret edenler<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"136\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 136.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 37.6 44.3 60.0 66.7 75.0 75.0 84.0 93.0 99.7 111.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.6 44.3 84.0 99.7 111.7 120.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> muhaceret edib sizinle beraber mücahede edenler<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"85\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 85.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 33.0 33.0 39.8 39.8 39.8 47.3 47.3 55.6 55.6 62.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 62.3 69.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> imdi bunlar: bu üç sıfatla muttasıf olanlar da <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"67\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 67.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 37.6 37.6 44.3 44.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"51.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> sizdendir. -Size mülhak ve sizden ma'dud «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"114\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 114.2 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.4 32.2 44.2 51.0 66.7 77.2 84.0 90.7 97.4 104.2\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"20.2\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » dırlar. Ey mü'minler <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"399\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 399.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 23.2 30.0 37.4 53.2 53.2 69.7 76.4 8